{{else}}
{{#if this.hasRoleAssignments}}

The role is in the security role assignments of the home. If it is not there yet, add it with the button in the role assignments.
{{/if}}
{{/if}}

The policy template has places for the things that a home can have or not have, for example an information security policy and an incident management process. Keep the ones that the organisation has, and remove the others.

Add the AI policy to the table of topic-specific policies in the information security policy, if the home has one. Communicate the AI policy to the employees and to the relevant contractors, and record their confirmations.

